lavender: boot-arg sweetfb_vhz=N - the display rate CoreAnimation sees (vsync ticks, modes), default 60

- SweetFramebuffer.cpp: vsync period and published rate from sweetfb_vhz
- idea from the first lavender project (its 1033); made by xnu/src/mk_vhz.py

